## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when crowd control, slows, or early magic damage keep Saber from exiting after Triple Sweep.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield protects the first dive better than a delayed revive.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP targets survive the first burst window too often.
- Total cost: 11860 gold

Default jungle setup for fast level-four pickoffs, using Orbiting Swords to prime Hunter Strike, Heptaseas, Lethal Ignition, and Flame Retribution around one locked target.

### Roam Dire Hit Charge (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Execute
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when Saber must walk through control-heavy river fights before reaching the enemy marksman or mage.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use before decisive Lord fights when dying after one trade would lose more value than the last damage slot adds.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use when magic burst can kill Saber before the Dire Hit dump, Execute, or Sky Piercer finish the target.
- Total cost: 11280 gold

Damage-roam setup for isolated backline punish. Force builds on the rotation and not in the bush, so arrive on the move and let Charge spend it, and keep Sky Piercer only while Saber can avoid the deaths that drain its own stacks.

### Jungle Armor Breaker (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Sea Halberd, Blade of Despair
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has little chain control and shorter Orbiting Swords plus Charge cycles decide the skirmish.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use when Saber is the only reliable objective finisher and cannot risk a shutdown before Lord.; Athena's Shield over Sea Halberd when Use against front-loaded magic burst when anti-heal is less important than surviving the entry.
- Total cost: 11930 gold

Armor-break jungle setup for tankier drafts where Saber still hunts priority targets but needs War Axe, passive stacks, Sea Halberd, and Malefic Roar to punish durable cores.

